<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Completion of Private Placement of New Shares</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">As disclosed in the Report on <A HREF="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1999860/000121390026086127/ea0300957-6k_wingyip.htm">Form 6-K</A> filed by the Company with the
Securities and Exchange Commission on August 6, 2026 (the &ldquo;Prior 6-K&rdquo;), the shareholders of Wing Yip Food Holdings Group Limited
(the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) approved, at the 12th Extraordinary General Meeting held on August 6, 2026 (the &ldquo;EGM&rdquo;), the issuance
of an aggregate of 23,000,000 new ordinary shares (the &ldquo;New Shares&rdquo;) by way of private placement (third-party allotment) to
Wang Tingfeng, Wong Sio Chan and Zhao Jin Hua (collectively, the &ldquo;Subscribers&rdquo;) at a price of KRW 1,600 per share, for an
aggregate subscription price of KRW 36,800,000,000 (approximately HKD 194,698,693.20).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The Company hereby announces that the issuance of the New Shares has
been completed. The New Shares were issued on August 7, 2026 and were listed on the Korea Exchange (&ldquo;KRX&rdquo;) on September 7,
2026. Following the issuance, the total number of issued ordinary shares of the Company is 35,582,732 shares.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

