<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Pursuant to lock-up undertaking letters executed by each of the Subscribers,
all 23,000,000 New Shares are subject to a lock-up period of one (1) year, from September 7, 2026 to September 6, 2027.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The New Shares rank <I>pari passu</I> with the existing ordinary shares
of the Company in all respects. The proceeds from the issuance of the New Shares are intended to be used for working capital purposes,
including procurement costs, marketing expenses and research and development, as previously disclosed.</P>

